WEBVTT

00:00:00.145 --> 00:00:02.860
It's nine at night, at your
third location.

00:00:03.305 --> 00:00:05.820
A customer calls, and your AI
answers.

00:00:06.225 --> 00:00:07.770
Do you actually know what it
said?

00:00:08.545 --> 00:00:11.320
Your vendor's report says the
call was handled.

00:00:11.805 --> 00:00:13.900
The recording might tell a
different story.

00:00:14.325 --> 00:00:16.280
Did it quote a price you never
approved?

00:00:16.605 --> 00:00:18.560
Promise a slot nobody checked?

00:00:18.965 --> 00:00:20.600
Vendors grade their own
homework.

00:00:21.495 --> 00:00:24.450
ZeroHand tests the agents you
already run:

00:00:24.815 --> 00:00:27.930
the after-hours line, the chat,
the follow-up.

00:00:28.335 --> 00:00:31.550
Every location you approve,
against rules you set,

00:00:31.715 --> 00:00:33.850
starting from a baseline you
agree to.

00:00:34.315 --> 00:00:36.970
You hear the recordings behind
every finding.

00:00:37.845 --> 00:00:38.825
Grow the shop.

00:00:38.845 --> 00:00:39.825
Not the back office.

00:00:39.845 --> 00:00:41.320
ZeroHand Labs.
